  "questionText": "Consider a relational database containing the following schemas.<br><br><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Catalogue</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center;\"><thead><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\"><u>sno</u></th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\"><u>pno</u></th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">150</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">50</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">100</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">200</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P5</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">250</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">250</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">150</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P5</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">300</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">250</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Suppliers</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center;\"><thead><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\"><u>sno</u></th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">sname</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">location</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">M/s Royal furniture</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Delhi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">M/s Balaji furniture</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Bangalore</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">S3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">M/s Premium furniture</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Chennai</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Parts</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ffffff; text-align: center;\"><thead><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\"><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\"><u>pno</u></th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">pname</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">part_spec</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Table</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Wood</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Chair</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Wood</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Table</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Steel</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Almirah</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Steel</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">P5</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Almirah</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 4px 12px;\">Wood</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><br>The primary key of each table is indicated by underlining the constituent fields.<br><br>The number of rows returned by the above SQL query is",
